{{!--
Site header, shared by every template: logo, main navigation with a « Plus » popover (the secondary
navigation, plus the main items that do not fit) and a « ••• » panel (recent posts and tags,
header-discover.hbs; also in the phone menu sheet), search (Ghost's native search, data-ghost-search),
theme switch, « S'abonner » for visitors or « Compte » for members. Phones get a top bar (search,
subscribe or account, menu button), a row of navigation pills under it and a menu sheet.
The bar sticks to the top of the page; app.js sets data-scrolled once the page has scrolled, and
data-hidden while it is out of the way after a fast scroll down.
The markup is in header-body.hbs; this partial only runs the server queries the header needs, once each
(the desktop panel and the phone sheet share the posts and the tags; the two « S'abonner » buttons share
the subscription page), and passes the results down.

Parameters:
  home=true   home page: the bar starts without its logo while the hero wordmark is visible and
              home.js docks the logo into it on scroll (data-dock="undocked" | "docked" on the header).
              Every other page always shows the logo.

Stable hooks (other scripts rely on them): #site-header, [data-header-logo] (the logo link: the
target of the hero wordmark for docking and page transitions), [data-ghost-search].
--}}
{{!-- A {{#get}} block changes the context: the block parameter top keeps the parameters of this partial --}}
{{#with this as |top|}}
  {{#get "posts" limit="6" include="tags" as |discoverposts|}}
    {{#get "tags" filter="visibility:public" include="count.posts" order="count.posts desc" limit="12" as |discovertags|}}
      {{#if @member}}
        {{> header-body home=top.home discoverposts=discoverposts discovertags=discovertags}}
      {{else if @custom.subscribe_url}}
        {{> header-body home=top.home discoverposts=discoverposts discovertags=discovertags}}
      {{else if top.subscribePagesKnown}}
        {{> header-body home=top.home discoverposts=discoverposts discovertags=discovertags subscribePages=top.subscribePages subscribePagesKnown=true}}
      {{else}}
        {{#get "pages" filter="slug:[newsletter,abonnement,subscribe]" limit="1" as |subscribepages|}}
          {{> header-body home=top.home discoverposts=discoverposts discovertags=discovertags subscribePages=subscribepages subscribePagesKnown=true}}
        {{else}}
          {{> header-body home=top.home discoverposts=discoverposts discovertags=discovertags}}
        {{/get}}
      {{/if}}
    {{/get}}
  {{/get}}
{{/with}}
